{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328730/extras/9640442be808df9e155e324981d01b7d.poster.avif?t=1759825682\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328730/extras/9640442be808df9e155e324981d01b7d.webm?t=1759825682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328730/extras/9640442be808df9e155e324981d01b7d.mp4?t=1759825682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Autogun Heroes: Supercharged is a thrilling <strong>roguelike shoot-'em-up</strong> that combines intense, skill-based 2D action platforming with tight, responsive controls. Fight through alien-infested planets, where every run is a fresh challenge filled with unpredictable enemies, levels, and powerful upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR HERO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328730/extras/6c2381a5026915edaa3c975a69590575.poster.avif?t=1759825682\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328730/extras/6c2381a5026915edaa3c975a69590575.webm?t=1759825682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328730/extras/6c2381a5026915edaa3c975a69590575.mp4?t=1759825682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your hero, rescue your captured crew, and build an unstoppable team. <strong>Each character comes with unique abilities</strong>\u2014like blazing fire rates, devastating power-ups, or versatile jetpacks\u2014allowing you to strategically match your playstyle. <strong>With every crew member rescued, your arsenal and strategy evolve dynamically</strong>, making every run feel new, challenging, and exhilarating. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OPTIMIZE WITH  WEAPONS, ARMOUR AND EQUIPMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328730/extras/7ae82a56270ebb4660f455263b6ea211.poster.avif?t=1759825682\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328730/extras/7ae82a56270ebb4660f455263b6ea211.webm?t=1759825682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328730/extras/7ae82a56270ebb4660f455263b6ea211.mp4?t=1759825682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your characters with an extensive array of weapons, gadgets, and armor. Enhance specific stats like damage, fire rate, and defense, crafting the perfect loadout to match your preferred gameplay style. Experimentation is key\u2014<strong>optimize your gear to overcome the ever-changing threats of the roguelike galaxy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for relentless action, addictive replayability, and thrilling gameplay loops designed specifically for roguelike fans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WISHLIST NOW!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Factory Destroyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3328730/228677c20fa349efea9d0a4c96e473a293038874.jpg"},{"name":"Prison Break","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3328730/87a5e8e51307ba41b7c8230dbd0e0501166ce5c0.jpg"},{"name":"Earth Here We Come","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/332873